{"cls":"level","html":"\n<div class=\"hm\" id=\"hmTop\"><h1 class=\"hm-t\">AI, explained plainly</h1><p class=\"hm-s\">Pictures and small experiments, layer by layer: how to use AI, how to build with it, why it works.</p><div class=\"hm-go\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b pri\" data-tour=\"start\">🎬 Follow one sentence through</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b kid\" data-route=\"kid\" data-go=\"T1\">🧒 Kids’ route · 6 stops</button></div></div><!--m2door--><nav class=\"m-door hm-door\" aria-label=\"I want to…\"><p class=\"dr-h\">👋 What do you want to do? Tap one</p><div class=\"dr-g\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"Api\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔌</span><b>Call a model from my code</b><span class=\"dr-s\">keys · first call · cost</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"Loc\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">💻</span><b>Run a model on my computer</b><span class=\"dr-s\">enough memory? · which tool</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"Job\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤖</span><b>Let an AI do tasks for me</b><span class=\"dr-s\">pick an agent by task · products</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"Skl\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🧰</span><b>Add skills to an AI</b><span class=\"dr-s\">tools · MCP · skill packs</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"Bld\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛠</span><b>Build my own agent</b><span class=\"dr-s\">platform or code, step by step</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dr-m\" data-go=\"T1\"><span class=\"dr-i\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🧠</span><b>Understand how it works</b><span class=\"dr-s\">route map · big picture to detail</span></button></div></nav><!--/m2door--><div class=\"hm-sh\" id=\"hmShare\"><p class=\"hm-h\">📣 Useful? Share it with a friend</p><div class=\"hm-shb\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b\" data-hm=\"share\">🔗 Share this site</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b\" data-hm=\"poster\">🏅 My progress card</button></div><p class=\"hm-nt\">The ↗ at the top right of every page shares that page.</p></div><details class=\"hm-more\" id=\"hmMore\"><summary>Go deeper: how this site is laid out</summary><div class=\"hm-mb\"><ol class=\"hm-lv\" aria-label=\"Three levels\"><li class=\"on\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\">🏠</i><b>Home</b><small>pick an “I want to…”</small></li><li><i aria-hidden=\"true\">📂</i><b>Zone</b><small>the whole of one job</small></li><li><i aria-hidden=\"true\">🔬</i><b>Detail stop</b><small>one idea in depth</small></li></ol><ul class=\"pts\"><li>The line at the top of each page says <b>where you are</b>: ⬆ goes up a level, ⬇ drills down.</li><li>Bottom bar: 📑 this page, 🧪 experiments, ✅ quiz, ✨ progress, ▶ next stop.</li></ul><p class=\"hm-all\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b\" data-hm=\"drawer\">🧭 All 27 stops</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"hm-b\" data-hm=\"search\">🔍 Search</button></p></div></details>\n"}
